sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GEN as Q-Gen (AI)
  participant UI as UI
  participant LRN as Learner
  participant COA as Coach/Orchestrator
  participant LM as Learner Model
  participant ATT as Attention
  participant EMO as Emotional
  participant MEM as Memory
  participant SCR as Web Scraper
  participant FT as Fine-tuning

  SCR->>FT: Subject corpus (web + syllabus)
  FT->>GEN: Fine-tuned transformer (domain)
  Note over SCR, GEN: Offline prep (periodic): scrape -> fine-tune -> deploy

  COA->>GEN: Generate question (subject + strategy)
  GEN->>UI: Question
  UI->>LRN: Show question
  LRN->>UI: Answer
  UI->>COA: Log response (correctness, time, confidence)
  Note over UI, COA: via Telemetry and optional affect (self-report/text)

  par Interaction signals
    UI->>ATT: Interaction traces (latency, hints, errors)
    ATT->>COA: load signals (latency_z, error_streak)
  and Affect signals
    UI->>EMO: Text/self-report
    EMO->>COA: affect (frustration, demotivation)
  end

  COA->>LM: Update mastery/calibration/fatigue
  COA->>MEM: Update review policy
  MEM->>COA: Next review recommendations
  COA->>GEN: Strategy update (difficulty, Bloom mix, focus concepts)

  loop Next item
    COA->>GEN: Generate next question
    GEN->>UI: Question
    UI->>LRN: Show
    LRN->>UI: Answer
    UI->>COA: Log response (+ affect if available)
    UI->>ATT: Traces
    ATT->>COA: load
    UI->>EMO: Text/self-report
    EMO->>COA: affect
    COA->>LM: Update
    COA->>MEM: Policy
    MEM->>COA: Reviews
    COA->>GEN: Strategy update
  end
